    "summary": "malicious authenticated client of a shared split learning/inference service (S1/S2/S3): controls only its own inputs and updates but shares the cloud body with honest clients \u2014 crafted-activation body extraction, sensitive-neuron observability, gradient poisoning, numerical-instability bombs, budget-limited extraction, and sybil collusion",
